### 20. Listar Todas as Cargas
GET http://localhost:3000/cargas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 21. Consultar Carga por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/carga/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 22. Cadastrar Entrega 1 (Data: 25/10/2026 - Carga 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Florianópolis",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

### 23. Cadastrar Entrega 2 (Data: 05/10/2026 - Carga 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Joinville",
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-05",
    "hora": "10:30:00",
    "idCarga": 2
}

### 24. Cadastrar Entrega 3 (Data: 15/10/2026 - Carga 3)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Blumenau",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-15",
    "hora": "16:00:00",
    "idCarga": 3
}

### 25. Cadastrar Entrega com status inválido (Deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Blumenau",
    "status": "CANCELADO",
    "data": "2026-10-15",
    "hora": "16:00:00",
    "idCarga": 3
}

### 26. Atualizar Status da Entrega 1 (Altera para ENTREGUE em 30/10/2026)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

### 27. Atualizar Entrega Inexistente (Deve retornar erro 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE"
}

### 28. Consultar Entrega por ID (codEntrega é o código de rastreio)
GET http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 29. Listar Entregas Ordenadas por Data (Deve retornar a ordem: 30/10, 15/10 e 05/10)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 30. Testar Rota Protegida Sem Token (Deve retornar erro 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas

### 31. Deletar Motorista Inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/999
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 32. Deletar Motorista 3 (Pedro)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
